    // The OBJ / MTL / DXF of the grouping scenario (conditions Wall A, Column, Pier 1/2, Slab, an unnamed condition without a
    // condition type name, a linear condition whose only takeoff has one point; takeoffs t1..t8, t5 is the hole of the slab t4),
    // display mode Original: group = '# name' line, g / usemtl name, v and f counts of the group; material = newmtl, '# name', Kd.
